# The environment `make coverage` runs tests/tools/ in, exact pins rather
# than `>=` floors.
#
# A floor resolves to whatever is newest on PyPI when the environment is
# built, which puts the seven day `minimumReleaseAge` in
# .github/renovate.json5 out of the loop entirely: that window governs when
# Renovate proposes a change, not what pip installs.
#
# tests/requirements.txt is compiled from this file with hashes; regenerate
# it with the command in its header (see docs/CONTRIBUTING.md), never edit it
# by hand. The Tests job in .github/workflows/pull-request.yml installs the
# same lock, so the self-test suite and `make coverage` share one
# environment.
#
# pytest runs the tests of tools/kcov_to_sonar.py, and coverage measures
# them for SonarQube Cloud.
coverage==7.16.1
pytest==9.1.1
# The self-test suite: pre-commit runs every phase that installs hooks,
# pyyaml reads the hook definitions in the selectors phase, and
# detect-secrets is the tool the security checklists and install.sh call.
# pre-commit stays at the version the Pre-commit job installs.
detect-secrets==1.5.0
pre-commit==4.5.1
pyyaml==6.0.3
